note a list holds many values of the same kind. Separate them with and.
let pets be a list of the words cat and the words dog and the words fish
note when more words come after text, close the text with end words.
add the words bird end words to pets
for each pet in pets do
say the words I like followed by pet
end for
say the words I have followed by length of pets followed by the words pets
note entry 1 of pets is the first one.
say entry 1 of pets
